  "description": "Deprecated: use Pondhawk.Logging.Journald, which writes native journal fields under systemd and the same line anywhere else. A ZLogger-based Microsoft.Extensions.Logging console optimized for systemd-journald: sd-daemon priority prefixes (<N>), no timestamp, and no ANSI color. Fixed at Warning for Linux production services that surface only warnings and errors.",
